	(text "KUMANDA RADYO MODULU (RFD900ux-SMT; 868 MHz icin RFD868ux-SMT). Baglanti RX kartindakinin aynisi:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "345516cf-8e94-5868-86d9-f6e0615c1b78")
	)
	(text "Cikis = 1,0 V x (1 + 422k / 100k) = 5,22 V. Giris cikistan yuksekse (USB'de) entegre girisi dogrudan cikisa aktarir (en cok 5,5 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 270 34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "85349171-1de3-58a1-a5f4-bd4902404ba7")
	)
	(text "RADYO BESLEMESI (TPS61230, yukselten): +SYS (3,0-5,5 V) -> 5,2 V. Modul verirken 1 A tepe ceker; entegre 3,3 V giristen 2,1 A verebilir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 270 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "88e20ae6-fb78-52f5-89e9-112649b7d9e0")
	)
	(text "GIRIS KARTI BAGLANTISI (20 kontakli yassi kablo): uc sirasi 13_DOKUMANTASYON/KUMANDA_ARAYUZU.md ile birebir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 270 170 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "991c5069-0d69-59ae-8c1e-bece9eaaf07f")
	)
	(text "islemciden gelen hatlarda 470R, SWO ucu yazilim yukleme kipi icin islemcide (RADIO_BOOT_N)."
